**validPrimes(n)** = {p prime : pₙ < p < P and P + p is prime}

**deaconescuConjecture**: For all n ≥ 1, validPrimes(n) is nonempty.

**erdos779Conjecture**: Alternative formulation using 0-indexed primes and inline product, matching the formal-conjectures syntax. The two formulations are equivalent up to index shifts.
